{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36597","headline":"送臧濆下第谒窦鄜州 · 罗隐","name":"送臧濆下第谒窦鄜州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"赋得长杨不直钱，却来京口看莺迁。\n也知绦灌轻才子，好谒尤常醉少年。\n万里故乡云缥缈，一春生计泪澜丸。\n多情柱史应相问，与话归心正浩然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36597.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36597","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}